Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, two and a half months off the match court{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N离开赛场两个半月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.76,0:00:07.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's not stopped Alejandro Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也没挡住达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:12.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from roaring into a seventh ATP Tour level final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N杀进生涯第七个巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.87,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}差一点 他就停在了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}28{\fs68}号下午{\fs78}5{\fs68}点多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}成都公开赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:21.39,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}号种子达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:24.35,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}对从资格赛打上来的巴西拉什维利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.35,0:00:25.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}离开赛场两个半月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是他回来的第一站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:32.19,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 开局就被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:34.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他一直没追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:41.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the qualifier continues to roll here in Chengdu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位资格赛球员还在一路向前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘第二局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:45.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴西拉什维利发球 {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.34,0:00:46.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他回发球就压上去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}把对手在底线左右调动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一个破发点就兑现 {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:59.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先 却被连扳{\fs78}3{\fs68}局 四平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:34.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, made it. Just dropped in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N进了 刚好压在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一局他保住了 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:40.17,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴西拉什维利接着发球 {\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他拿到盘点 第一个就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.81,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.90,0:01:47.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘他先破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.86,0:01:48.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}下一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:51.19,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴西拉什维利连拿{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:52.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是第二个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:55.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}被调动到右边滑步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.74,0:01:58.93,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}又追到左边底线 拿下这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:03.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Davidovich Fokina. Two saved, one still to come.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N救下两个 还有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第三个 第四个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:07.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他也全救了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}那局又救两个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘巴西拉什维利{\fs78}6{\fs68}次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:13.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一次都没兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:16.44,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 他发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:19.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68} 第一个赛点就拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:20.82,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他攥紧了拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:23.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}全场{\fs78}9{\fs68}个破发点 他救下{\fs78}7{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:26.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}打进了生涯第七个巡回赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.11,0:02:27.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决赛对手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:30.58,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}是胡尔卡奇和沙波瓦洛夫之间的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:34.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一次 他能把冠军留在成都吗？
